Third-party robot models in this directory
==========================================

universal_robots_ur10e/ur10e.xml, universal_robots_ur5e/ur5e.xml

  Source: MuJoCo Menagerie (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie),
  directories universal_robots_ur10e and universal_robots_ur5e at commit
  98a70c569c4c1b6da467a20012f766ee1f8dc521. Menagerie derived these models from the
  ROS-Industrial ur_e_description URDF
  (https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot).

  Copyright 2018 ROS Industrial Consortium.
  License: BSD-3-Clause. The full licence text is in the LICENSE file next to each
  model and must be kept with any redistribution.

  Modifications made here: the visual mesh assets and the display-only mesh geoms
  that referenced them were removed. Kinematics, inertias, joint ranges, collision
  geometry, actuators and keyframes are unchanged. MIRROR composes these models with
  its own scene, gripper and actuators at load time (mirror/arm/model.py); that
  composition is not part of the vendored files.

